('115.27.b.21.A',3,'Exploitation means...','["taking unfair advantage of someone for another person''s benefit", "volunteering", "helping a friend", "sharing a snack"]'::jsonb,0,'Exploitation is a form of abuse.','original'),
('115.27.b.21.B',3,'A victim of sexual abuse may experience emotional impacts such as...','["no effects at all", "fear, shame, anxiety or depression", "higher confidence", "improved sleep"]'::jsonb,1,'Abuse can cause serious emotional harm.','original'),
('115.27.b.21.B',3,'Sex trafficking harms victims by...','["giving them a job", "paying fair wages", "using force, fraud or coercion to exploit them", "protecting them"]'::jsonb,2,'Trafficking is exploitation.','original'),
('115.27.b.21.C',3,'Dating violence is...','["a first date", "a single disagreement", "an argument about music", "a pattern of abusive behavior in a dating relationship"]'::jsonb,3,'Dating violence involves control or harm.','original'),
('115.27.b.21.D',3,'A way to avoid unsafe situations that raise the risk of harassment or assault is to...','["stay with trusted friends and tell someone where you are going", "go alone to unknown places", "accept rides from strangers", "share your location publicly"]'::jsonb,0,'Planning and staying with trusted people reduce risk.','original'),
('115.27.b.21.D',3,'Which is a protective strategy for teens?','["meeting an online contact alone", "avoiding isolated places with someone you do not know well", "ignoring a bad feeling", "leaving a drink unattended"]'::jsonb,1,'Awareness and caution protect safety.','original'),
('115.27.b.21.E',3,'A teen who experiences sexual harassment should...','["ignore it", "blame themselves", "tell a parent or another trusted adult", "keep it secret"]'::jsonb,2,'Reporting is the first step to safety.','original'),
