('115.27.b.21.F',3,'A healthy sense of self helps a person to...','["set and keep personal boundaries", "ignore their own needs", "give up decisions", "please everyone"]'::jsonb,0,'Self-respect supports boundaries.','original'),
('115.27.b.21.F',3,'Personal boundaries are...','["school rules", "limits that help you feel safe and respected", "legal contracts", "secret codes"]'::jsonb,1,'Boundaries protect well-being.','original'),
('115.27.b.21.G',3,'Which is an effective refusal statement?','["''I guess so.''", "''Whatever you want.''", "''No, I''m not doing that. Let''s do something else.''", "''Maybe later.''"]'::jsonb,2,'Clear, firm statements work best.','original'),
('115.27.b.21.H',3,'Respecting another person''s boundaries means...','["ignoring their feelings", "testing their limits", "arguing until they agree", "accepting their ''no'' without pressure"]'::jsonb,3,'Respecting boundaries is essential.','original'),
('115.27.b.21.H',3,'Everyone has the right to...','["decide who touches their body and how", "control others", "keep rules secret", "ignore consent"]'::jsonb,0,'People have a right to bodily autonomy.','original'),
('115.27.b.22.A',3,'A change that occurs in females during puberty is...','["facial hair", "the start of menstruation", "a deeper voice", "larger vocal cords only"]'::jsonb,1,'Menstruation begins in puberty.','original'),
('115.27.b.22.B',3,'Pregnancy can result from...','["shaking hands", "sharing a drink", "sexual intercourse between a male and a female", "swimming in a pool"]'::jsonb,2,'Fertilization happens through sexual intercourse.','original'),
('115.27.b.22.C',3,'A developing fetus can be harmed if the mother uses...','["milk", "prenatal vitamins", "exercise approved by a doctor", "alcohol, tobacco or drugs"]'::jsonb,3,'Substances cross the placenta.','original'),
