('115.27.b.23.I',3,'Which can be an emotional consequence of early sexual activity?','["no emotions ever", "feeling guilt or being hurt by a breakup", "improved test scores", "gaining height"]'::jsonb,1,'Emotional risks are real.','original'),
('115.27.b.23.J',3,'A strategy to remain abstinent is to...','["ignore your values", "go places alone with someone you barely know", "set personal limits and avoid risky situations", "drink alcohol at parties"]'::jsonb,2,'Planning ahead supports abstinence.','original'),
